            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "When it happens, everyone will say, “He is our God! We have put our trust in him, and he has rescued us. He is the ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.25.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.25.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": "! We have put our trust in him, and now we are happy and joyful because he has saved us.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.25.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.25.9"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
